OL,3,GNEWSA'It's tradition' - Hundreds gather
OL,4,Afor huge annual bonfire on housing
OL,5,Aestate
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of residents have attended a
OL,8,F"massive" community-run bonfire at a
OL,9,Fhousing estate, with one saying it
OL,10,Fhelped bring "people together".
OL,12,FThe "unofficial" event took place at
OL,13,FPenrhys housing estate in Rhondda Cynon
OL,14,FTaf, on Thursday, featuring a bonfire
OL,15,Festimated to be 80ft (24m) wide and
OL,16,F20ft (6m) tall.
OL,18,FResidents said the annual event has
OL,19,Fbeen running for almost 30 years and
OL,20,Fwas now known as a "tradition" for
OL,21,Flocal people, despite previous warnings
OL,22,Fabout safety.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
