OL,3,GNEWSA'It's tradition' - Hundreds gather
OL,4,Afor huge annual bonfire on housing
OL,5,Aestate
OL,6,
OL,7,FRhondda Cynon Taf council declined to
OL,8,Fcomment on this year's event but South
OL,9,FWales Fire and Rescue Service, which
OL,10,Furged people to attend licensed
OL,11,Ffirework displays, confirmed no
OL,12,Fincidents were reported at the event.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
